Pinboard 0.7.0:

* ''Open as story'' (bottom of the path panel) puts the story's tiddlers in order into the story river, also without a story tiddler.
* The story tiddler's ''Tiddler'' field now sits right under the story's name: name it before making it (Enter or ''Make a story tiddler''), rename it later and it stays tied to the story.
* ''Leads into board'' in the new card menu (⋯): pick the board a card dives into, or make a new empty one named after the card. Boards open above are greyed out.
* Narrower card tools: view, add to path and ⋯ (shown fields, link, appear/disappear, leads into board, remove).
